#EXTM3U
# Extra streams for any USA TV Next channel. Two lines per stream: the channel
# name exactly as it appears in USA TV Next, then the link.
#
#   #EXTINF:-1,TBS
#   https://example.com/tbs/index.m3u8
#
# Run `python3 build.py` after editing.

